.TH DANBY-JAVELIN 1
.SH NAME
danby-javelin \- aerodynamic motion of a javelin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/javelin
.SH MODEL
The javelin begins at release height and experiences gravity, quadratic drag,
and attitude-dependent lift.  The controls permit comparison with vacuum
flight and exploration of release angle and aerodynamic attitude.
